oltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Good_Luck\" title=\"Good Luck\">Good Luck  +2</a>:</b> This item gives a +2 <a href=\"/page/Luck_bonus\" title=\"Luck bonus\">Luck bonus</a> to all saves and skill checks.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Staff_of_Arcane_Power:_Spell_Selection\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Power: Spell Selection\">Staff of Arcane Power: Spell Selection</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Staff_of_Arcane_Power:_Spell_Selection\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Power: Spell Selection\">Staff of Arcane Power: Spell Selection</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 12<br /><b>Charges: </b>25 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 25 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Biting_Sands\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Biting Sands</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Biting_Sands\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Biting Sands</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+2% Artifact bonus to Force Spellcrit Chance<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Force Spellpower<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Magical Resistance Rating Cap</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png/420px-Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"788\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Staff_of_Arcane_Power\" title=\"Item:Epic Staff of Arcane Power\">Epic Staff of Arcane Power</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This staff began as a ceremonial weapon created by the gnolls of the desert. Long years of use by powerful shaman have gradually increased the staff's power. This process has accelerated lately as the staff has been involved in powerful summoning ritual.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li>Staff of Arcane Power: Spell Selection\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Ray_of_Enfeeblement\" title=\"Ray of Enfeeblement\">Ray of Enfeeblement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Lightning_Bolt\" title=\"Lightning Bolt\">Lightning Bolt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\">Cone of Cold</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Hold_Monster\" title=\"Hold Monster\">Hold Monster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Globe_of_Invulnerability\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability\">Globe of Invulnerability</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816180321\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.215 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5244/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37447/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11983/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n133.83%  256.156     60 Template:IO\n100.00%  191.399      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  191.399      1 -total\n 97.24%  186.113      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 46.